s_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","review_id":"f2W7fVGNys1FegM4r2CcRg","date":"2019-08-21T19:41:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9536241292953491,"text_excerpt":"Very laid back spot to enjoy a few solid street tacos in an open outdoor sitting. There is no indoor sitting but expect quite a bit of shaded areas and a few industrial fans throughout the open space. It's a super casual space Ended up here for a weekday lunch meeting and it was very empty. We also ate at an off hour so that probably affected it a bit. Their menu is very concise and they focus on -- well, tacos and taco bowls. You'll kick yourself in the ass if you don't grab their chips and dips. Get the large queso. Splurge on the Guac. Add Chicharrones to your meal. Just drop the bills and go all out. (It's honestly not a crazy upcharge and the chicharrones are so worth the $2 extra bu..."},{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","review_id":"7x5Edynqoix4m_-COIGcdA","date":"2021-06-02T18:34:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9513834714889526,"text_excerpt":"In my quest to try every taco in town, Barracuda has been on my list for awhile. Finally, thanks to Juan's being closed today, I got my chance. Love the concept, as long as the weather cooperates, and today it did. We were there when they opened at Noon and found a table in the very spacious courtyard. Three of us split the chips & dips (queso & guacamole). I assumed we'd get salsa, but I apparently didn't order that, and with plenty of queso and guac, salsa would have been overkill. Great chips & dips... plenty for three of us. Margaritas (regular & spicy) were on point, too. For entrees, we enjoyed the chicken, pork, beef & crispy fish tacos. I was initially skeptical of the catfish in ..."},{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","review_id":"D9szwETzYbvrGf_LxaOF_A","date":"2020-12-01T21:35:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9481343030929565,"text_excerpt":"Such a cute spot! I've been dying to go here so my bf and I went right after work one day. They have a cute patio area for dining outside. The line works like this. You walk up and have to wait outside if someone is in the shack ordering. Once you place you order, you will grab your drinks at the side window and find a spot and place your number down on the table. The server will bring you your food. Its great! It was happy hour, Tues-Friday 3-6 PM, and I got the deluxe nachos add pork, a blood orange marg (I perf frozen or regular though), and a fish taco. DO NOT SLEEP ON THAT FISH TACO. The way it crunches with the pomegranate on top. YUMMMMS. Nachos were fire too. PICKLED CAULIFLOWER, ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","photo_id":"IDhi_dBhqnCdvrZQOgDGsw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/IDhi_dBhqnCdvrZQOgDGsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8996139168739319},{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","photo_id":"fI0Ri5cltNg4MOqe4Nev1Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fI0Ri5cltNg4MOqe4Nev1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8573280572891235},{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","photo_id":"mK82ZzGK99zJ2oOh_cwHRQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mK82ZzGK99zJ2oOh_cwHRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.822341799736023},{"business_id":"YjKuwQSJF1ErVYqRufXJMQ","photo_id":"czdN8